  Two tracks with a handle on each, rather than a keyboard or a ruler. A
  keyboard would name the input method instead of the subject, and a ruler reads
  as measuring something that already exists; what this opens is where the
  numbers behind the current tool are READ and SET.

  Drawn white and tinted at use; see EditorControlStyles.icon().
-->
